        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: संकल्प",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संकल्प — saṅkalpa — \"a resolution; a vow\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नवीन वर्षी मी रोज चालण्याचा संकल्प केला. navīn varṣī mī roj cālṇyācā saṅkalpa kelā. In the new year I resolved to walk every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संकल्प (saṅkalpa) करणे, to make a resolution."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संकल्प (saṅkalpa) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit saṁkalpa, \"resolve, intention\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
